name tokenizers
# The vocabularies of the tokenizers of the models kept on this machine: each token as the text it stands for, and the
# vocabulary as the path of its tokens in the order the tokenizer numbers them. Ordinary content: it attests nothing.
files $LAPLACE_MODELS/*/tokenizer.json
# Measured when it was loaded: 191,108 compositions from 9 MB, at 750 bytes each with their indexes and standings.
room 16
after unicode
reads vocabulary
